                <li><a href="https://fightchatcontrol.eu/">Fight Chat Control</a> - EU surveillance opposition</li>
                <li><a href="https://grapheneos.org/">GrapheneOS</a> - Privacy-focused Android OS</li>
                <li><a href="https://digdeeper.rodeo/">DigDeeper</a> - Privacy, OPSEC and Security guides</li>
            </ul>

