                <li><a href="https://metrolist.cc/">Metrolist</a> - Android YouTube Music client</li>
                <li><a href="https://repair.eu/">Right to Repair</a> - EU repair legislation</li>
                <li><a href="https://repair.wiki/">Repair Wiki</a> - Device repair guides and teardowns</li>
